      "message": "This trims the stats in place, this means if we send tpl stats to webm RC, our tpl stats for this libaom encoding run would be a bit incomplete (for this current GOP only) - This could have some unwanted behaviors, like an insufficiently boosted arf.\n\nWould it be possible to just make a temporary copy of it and then send the stats? Or maybe pass in the number of frames to send to the extrc_send_tpl_stats function?",
